---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LicensingCta from '../components/LicensingCta.astro';
---
<Base title="Licensing · Using-IT" description="Microsoft licenses through Using-IT's CSP partner. Sign up at minelicenser.dk in minutes.">
  <section class="article-hero wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Licensing</div>
    <h1>Microsoft licenses, without the hassle</h1>
    <div class="article-meta">Buy your Microsoft licenses in minutes</div>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p>I sell Microsoft licenses through my licensing portal <a href="https://minelicenser.dk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">minelicenser.dk</a>, with <a href="https://cloudfactory.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CloudFactory</a> as CSP partner.</p>
    <p>Getting started is fast: create your customer account, choose your products (Microsoft 365, Intune, Windows 365, and more), and you are on your way. No long commitments, no procurement project.</p>
    <p>If you want help sizing licenses or matching them to your setup, <a href="/about-me/">read about my consulting services</a> or reach out directly.</p>
    <LicensingCta />
  </div>
</Base>